'''Morgan's Vigil''' is an [[Alliance]] settlement in the southeastern corner of the [[Burning Steppes]]. It is only a small village left in ruins; with houses and structures burned to the ground and a single mage tower left crumbled and destroyed. Several tents have been erected for the inhabitants to live in. 

